<chapter xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude"  xml:id="chapter-15-intro">
  <title>Week 15</title>
  <introduction><p>
  This week will just be reviewing for the exam and initial interviews -- no new topics. Exam #4 will involve 
  developing full programs involving input and output.
  Be prepared to code a problem similar to  
  <url href="https://codingbat.com/java/Array-2" visual="codingbat Array-2">Array-2</url>
  on paper, from scratch (including method header definitions). Also be ready to write a 
  full program that reads, parses, and validates some input data and prints some output to a file.</p>
  </introduction>
</chapter>
